                </a>
              </td>
              <td class="py-3 px-3.5 text-[#565f89] whitespace-nowrap">&mdash;</td>
            </tr>
            <tr class="hover:bg-[#1a1b26]/50 transition-colors">
              <td class="py-3 px-3.5 text-[#c0caf5] font-medium">thermal: intel: int340x: Fix potential shift overflow in ptc_mmio_write</td>
              <td class="py-3 px-3.5 text-[#a9b1d6] whitespace-nowrap">Thermal / Intel int340x</td>
              <td class="py-3 px-3.5 whitespace-nowrap font-mono text-xs">
